              "pages": {
                "end": 59,
                "start": 59
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Kellogg, according to Michael Kellogg, the arbitration agreement should be enforced because the lower court\u2019s conditioning on class procedures is wrong under the Supreme Court\u2019s decision in *AT&T Mobility v. Concepcion*."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Michael Kellogg",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "6c9ca02ab89619ee4d04422844bbf2a100a82dda982232d048d801cba5a7355a",
