              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 21,
                "start": 21
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Plaintiffs, the plaintiff (American Express) argues that without the ability to obtain aggregate damages in a class action, the arbitration would not be worthwhile."
        }
